  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HANSEP: Health Market Systems Training (HMST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity HANSEP: Health Market Systems Training (HMST) is a component of Harnessing Non-State Actors for Better Health for the Poor (HANSHEP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;17,320. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Basic health care, STD control including HIV/AIDS, Tuberculosis control, Malaria control.</narrative>
  </description>
